ood, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PRrWtQ3rdINngwESZNefVQ","review_id":"l7gd5Fs0p8dEbvoHw3Ss4Q","date":"2019-05-25T00:46:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9283313155174255,"text_excerpt":"In a nice walkable area near the universities, Catalino's is a cute restaurant serving up some terrific eats. The ambiance is super cute a lot of art hung on the walls celebrating Guatemalan culture. Also the WHOLE MENU is gluten free!!!! How awesome is that? And many meals can be made low Fodmap as well just depending on your sensitivities. Now we don't drink- but the drinks seemed super popular, with many people commenting that they were good! Food was yummy and flavorful. The tortillas for the carnitas were fresh and I got a Pollo with crema that was really good- such a rich cream sauce for being gluten free- and the chicken was good, and I'm not a chicken person! Service was friendly...."},{"business_id":"PRrWtQ3rdINngwESZNefVQ","review_id":"IhiM1M9aQiLi3cctZFENSw","date":"2019-07-28T12:29:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9270815849304199,"text_excerpt":"In the span of one week, we've been to Catalino's twice now. Both times were on a Friday around normal dinnertime hours and we were seated immediately because they always seem to be half empty (or half full?). The first time I had the chicken cream laroco, the second time I had the tostadas and both times I had the elote. The elote is good, slightly less sweet than other restaurants that serve it despite the fact that I think the red sauce is actually ketchup (not judging- it's delicious). The tostadas are served on top of house made corn tortillas, pickled veggies, black beans, sweet plaintains (this normally would've been guac but they were out of avocados) and cotija cheese. Each of th..."},{"business_id":"PRrWtQ3rdINngwESZNefVQ","review_id":"h0OvqR81c8zYptTuGVf6CQ","date":"2018-12-20T20:13:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9264534711837769,"text_excerpt":"Came here on a Wednesday night, and we were the only people in the restaurant. The menu isn't huge, and they don't serve alcohol, but the food is delicious. We had the guacamole to start - fresh, tasty and with plaintain chips! So crispy and delicious. We split the Churrasco (steak) for dinner, after reading reviews and seeing how much food it was. It was the perfect amount for two people who were mildly hungry (wouldn't be enough for two if you're a big eater or super hungry). The steak was cooked to order - perfect temp - and the whole meal was good. They also have another menu with vegetarian options. Can't wait to go back and try something else! You can also BYOB and there's a $5 cork..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PRrWtQ3rdINngwESZNefVQ","photo_id":"ZvymvIetUAa8A0qag2FP-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZvymvIetUAa8A0qag2FP-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8885779976844788},{"business_id":"PRrWtQ3rdINngwESZNefVQ","photo_id":"Mry2XDZYS_rKCGy5b9ZNJw","label":